{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Etherburn is a student game and offers Souls-like gameplay in a medieval dark fantasy setting. Play as a revived Hero, a legendary knight who's name is lost to time. Your goal is to explore and escape the dungeon on one of many Routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/ExploreSlayDieRepeat.png?t=1743246037\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On your perilious Journey you will encounter Foes and might even die in Combat against them. But Death is not the End: The Dungeon is filled with the life-giving Powers of Ether - bringing you and your Enemies back to life in due time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/ExploreAMystDun.png?t=1743246037\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an interconnected Dungeon - filled with different Biomes and Areas to explore. Discover different parts of the Dungeon in a medieval dark fantasy setting in the attempt to find the right path to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357430/extras/SlayYourFoes.png?t=1743246037\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master various weapons and unleash deadly attacks to defeat your enemies. Weaken your foes and finish them off with brutal executions. Unlock new weapons as you journey through the Dungeon - looking for a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BBQ-ed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3357430/0bb3b1ed867aca35ba1d15c2d5e7c3fd637e99a9.jpg"},{"name":"How Did I Get Here ..?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s